{"transcription": [{"offsets": {"from": 0, "to": 3000}, "text": " Hi. A follow-up video to my previous one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 3000, "to": 8800}, "text": " Repairing, very simple repair, of a Tektronix DMM-916 multimeter."}, {"offsets": {"from": 8800, "to": 14500}, "text": " And as I showed in my Box of Mystery Multimeters video from my bunker, where I got these from,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 14500, "to": 23600}, "text": " I found another 3 meters here, both from 916s, but also a more better looking DMM-870."}, {"offsets": {"from": 23600, "to": 27899}, "text": " Not sure what the difference between these, I assume the 916 is the later model,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 27899, "to": 33299}, "text": " but it's 40,000 count, it's the same spec, like 0.06%."}, {"offsets": {"from": 33299, "to": 40599}, "text": " Um, it's, everything looks like I can't see any difference at all between these, actually."}, {"offsets": {"from": 40599, "to": 43200}, "text": " So I've got, I don't know, leave it in the comments down below."}, {"offsets": {"from": 43200, "to": 47799}, "text": " I mean, there's a slight difference in the silkscreen offset there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 47799, "to": 55299}, "text": " Like, it's just slightly, but like, apart from that, features seem to be exactly the same."}, {"offsets": {"from": 55400, "to": 59200}, "text": " Ah, anyway, yeah, let's do a repair-a-thon."}, {"offsets": {"from": 59200, "to": 63799}, "text": " I don't know if I'm going to be able to repair them, but anyway, let's take them apart, see what's wrong with them,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 63799, "to": 67199}, "text": " and hopefully we can get at least one or two of them working."}, {"offsets": {"from": 67199, "to": 69199}, "text": " Right, so we'll start off with the good-looking one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 69199, "to": 73800}, "text": " Let's get this out of here. These are all sold as faulty, by the way."}, {"offsets": {"from": 73800, "to": 78199}, "text": " So, last calibrated, 2099."}, {"offsets": {"from": 78199, "to": 82000}, "text": " So, yeah, calibration void, you see all broken."}, {"offsets": {"from": 82000, "to": 85300}, "text": " Seems to have the same power-on functions as the 916."}, {"offsets": {"from": 85300, "to": 88699}, "text": " No idea if there's any battery in this. Um, it doesn't do anything."}, {"offsets": {"from": 88699, "to": 90699}, "text": " If it is, it's probably long dead."}, {"offsets": {"from": 90699, "to": 92699}, "text": " Yeah, there's a battery, alright."}, {"offsets": {"from": 92699, "to": 97500}, "text": " Whoops, lost a, lost two screws. Where'd the other one go?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 97500, "to": 100199}, "text": " Okay, is that battery any good?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 100199, "to": 102500}, "text": " I'm going to need a multimeter to test it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 102500, "to": 109699}, "text": " Oh, oh, oh, um, I'm g..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 109699, "to": 112000}, "text": " Well, there's your problem."}, {"offsets": {"from": 112000, "to": 116500}, "text": " Wow, that is just, it's completely come out, look."}, {"offsets": {"from": 116500, "to": 120000}, "text": " So that, you can see, you can see the corrosion on that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 120000, "to": 123599}, "text": " Yeah, I think that's a bit of corrosion there, is it not?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 123599, "to": 127000}, "text": " So, is it that easy?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 127000, "to": 129399}, "text": " Probably not. Okay, let's get a good battery."}, {"offsets": {"from": 129399, "to": 134000}, "text": " Got the Duracell Industrials, they leak at twice the rate."}, {"offsets": {"from": 134000, "to": 138199}, "text": " Regular Duracells, industrial leakage action."}, {"offsets": {"from": 138199, "to": 140699}, "text": " I don't know, I've never seen an industrial one leak anyway."}, {"offsets": {"from": 140699, "to": 141699}, "text": " It just happened that way."}, {"offsets": {"from": 141699, "to": 144699}, "text": " Oh, March 2023, um, oops, oops."}, {"offsets": {"from": 144699, "to": 147699}, "text": " Had them for a while."}, {"offsets": {"from": 147699, "to": 149699}, "text": " They do measure good though."}, {"offsets": {"from": 149699, "to": 153699}, "text": " So, that's, there we go, there we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 153699, "to": 155699}, "text": " It's on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 155699, "to": 157699}, "text": " Oh, don't tell me that was it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 157699, "to": 159699}, "text": " Seriously?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 159699, "to": 162699}, "text": " I'm going to put the case back on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 162699, "to": 164699}, "text": " Just so that we're, we're good."}, {"offsets": {"from": 164699, "to": 166699}, "text": " Seriously, that cannot be the fault."}, {"offsets": {"from": 166699, "to": 167699}, "text": " That can't be it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 167699, "to": 169699}, "text": " Oh, I hate this top clip up here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 169699, "to": 171199}, "text": " Sorry, you can't easily see this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 171199, "to": 173699}, "text": " I should set up like a second camera."}, {"offsets": {"from": 173699, "to": 176699}, "text": " I did at one point, but eh, you know."}, {"offsets": {"from": 176699, "to": 180199}, "text": " Um, 13.4 volts, that's the compliance voltage."}, {"offsets": {"from": 180199, "to": 182199}, "text": " You've got it in the wrong range."}, {"offsets": {"from": 182199, "to": 183699}, "text": " Let's put it on voltage range."}, {"offsets": {"from": 183699, "to": 186199}, "text": " And, I'm getting zippity-doo-dah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 186199, "to": 188699}, "text": " We're going to have a problem with the input jacks, like we had last time."}, {"offsets": {"from": 188699, "to": 190699}, "text": " No, it helps if I press operate."}, {"offsets": {"from": 190699, "to": 191699}, "text": " It works."}, {"offsets": {"from": 191699, "to": 195699}, "text": " 0.9994 for my 1 volt input."}, {"offsets": {"from": 195699, "to": 196699}, "text": " Give that a wiggle, wiggle, wiggle."}, {"offsets": {"from": 196699, "to": 197699}, "text": " Yeah, it's solid."}, {"offsets": {"from": 197699, "to": 200699}, "text": " I might, um, screw those jacks up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 200699, "to": 201699}, "text": " To be sure."}, {"offsets": {"from": 201699, "to": 202699}, "text": " Millivolts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 202699, "to": 204699}, "text": " Let's go down a range."}, {"offsets": {"from": 204699, "to": 205699}, "text": " 100 millivolts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 205699, "to": 206699}, "text": " 99.96."}, {"offsets": {"from": 206699, "to": 208699}, "text": " No wuckers."}, {"offsets": {"from": 208699, "to": 209699}, "text": " 10 volts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 209699, "to": 211699}, "text": " 10.998."}, {"offsets": {"from": 211699, "to": 214699}, "text": " That's close."}, {"offsets": {"from": 214699, "to": 215699}, "text": " 1 volt."}, {"offsets": {"from": 215699, "to": 216699}, "text": " Eh, that's good."}, {"offsets": {"from": 216699, "to": 217699}, "text": " That's, that's within spec."}, {"offsets": {"from": 217699, "to": 219699}, "text": " It's a couple of counts low."}, {"offsets": {"from": 219699, "to": 223699}, "text": " But, um, millivolts, millivolts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 223699, "to": 224699}, "text": " 100."}, {"offsets": {"from": 224699, "to": 225699}, "text": " Bang on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 225699, "to": 226699}, "text": " Ah, goodness."}, {"offsets": {"from": 226699, "to": 228699}, "text": " So much for a repair video."}, {"offsets": {"from": 228699, "to": 229699}, "text": " Ah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 229699, "to": 230699}, "text": " 10k."}, {"offsets": {"from": 230699, "to": 231699}, "text": " Let's measure the ohmsky."}, {"offsets": {"from": 231699, "to": 232699}, "text": " 9.995."}, {"offsets": {"from": 232699, "to": 234699}, "text": " Yeah, it's exactly like the other one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 234699, "to": 237699}, "text": " I, ah, it's unbelievable."}, {"offsets": {"from": 237699, "to": 238699}, "text": " 1 milliamp."}, {"offsets": {"from": 238699, "to": 239699}, "text": " Microamp range."}, {"offsets": {"from": 239699, "to": 240699}, "text": " 1000."}, {"offsets": {"from": 240699, "to": 241699}, "text": " Yep."}, {"offsets": {"from": 241699, "to": 242699}, "text": " No worries."}, {"offsets": {"from": 242699, "to": 243699}, "text": " It's negative."}, {"offsets": {"from": 243699, "to": 244699}, "text": " All the electrons are going to fall out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 244699, "to": 245699}, "text": " 100 milliamps."}, {"offsets": {"from": 245699, "to": 246699}, "text": " Bang on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 246699, "to": 247699}, "text": " 10 milliamps."}, {"offsets": {"from": 247699, "to": 248699}, "text": " Bang on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 248699, "to": 250699}, "text": " And, put it over the amps jack."}, {"offsets": {"from": 250699, "to": 253699}, "text": " And, I'm going to have to up that range."}, {"offsets": {"from": 253699, "to": 255699}, "text": " This can only generate 100 milliamps."}, {"offsets": {"from": 255699, "to": 257700}, "text": " And, ah, it's 100 milliamps."}, {"offsets": {"from": 257700, "to": 258700}, "text": " I'll check that a bit more thoroughly."}, {"offsets": {"from": 258700, "to": 260700}, "text": " But, that is a winner winner chicken dinner."}, {"offsets": {"from": 260700, "to": 261700}, "text": " Seriously."}, {"offsets": {"from": 261700, "to": 265700}, "text": " Like, I, I'm sure I went through all, all of these at the time."}, {"offsets": {"from": 265700, "to": 269700}, "text": " And, because I had like, like, I don't know, eight of these or something."}, {"offsets": {"from": 269700, "to": 270700}, "text": " I had a lot."}, {"offsets": {"from": 270700, "to": 272700}, "text": " And, I went through and tested them all."}, {"offsets": {"from": 272700, "to": 276700}, "text": " And, the ones that worked, I sold them at the time."}, {"offsets": {"from": 276700, "to": 282700}, "text": " So, I'll just tighten the, they, they, they felt a little bit loose."}, {"offsets": {"from": 282700, "to": 285700}, "text": " But, yeah, a little bit loose there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 285700, "to": 287700}, "text": " Just tighten those up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 287700, "to": 292700}, "text": " Just to pierce through any potential oxide coating build up on there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 292700, "to": 294700}, "text": " But, yeah, the fuses are intact."}, {"offsets": {"from": 294700, "to": 295700}, "text": " They're all original."}, {"offsets": {"from": 295700, "to": 300700}, "text": " Um, the, the 870 model, that looks identical, doesn't it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 300700, "to": 302700}, "text": " That looks identical."}, {"offsets": {"from": 302700, "to": 305700}, "text": " Layout, PCB, it's got the, um, solder mask removed."}, {"offsets": {"from": 305700, "to": 308700}, "text": " Exactly like the 916."}, {"offsets": {"from": 308700, "to": 312700}, "text": " Um, the 870 is the top of the range of the 800 series."}, {"offsets": {"from": 312700, "to": 315700}, "text": " Like the 916 is the top of the range of the 900 series."}, {"offsets": {"from": 315700, "to": 318700}, "text": " So, ah, seems to be an identical meter."}, {"offsets": {"from": 318700, "to": 321700}, "text": " Maybe they sold them in different markets."}, {"offsets": {"from": 321700, "to": 323700}, "text": " Maybe there's some little feature difference there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 323700, "to": 325700}, "text": " But, they're all true RMS."}, {"offsets": {"from": 325700, "to": 328700}, "text": " They're, I think the LCD is the same in them, isn't it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 328700, "to": 331700}, "text": " That one, I'll give it a, a few more tests."}, {"offsets": {"from": 331700, "to": 333700}, "text": " But, that one is going straight to my eBay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 333700, "to": 335700}, "text": " So, I'll put that on my eBay store as well."}, {"offsets": {"from": 336700, "to": 338700}, "text": " So, I'll link it in."}, {"offsets": {"from": 338700, "to": 340700}, "text": " I'll start it at 99 cents."}, {"offsets": {"from": 340700, "to": 344700}, "text": " The, uh, I think there's like 6 hours left on the auction for the other one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 344700, "to": 346700}, "text": " That works. A treat."}, {"offsets": {"from": 346700, "to": 349700}, "text": " Um, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 349700, "to": 352700}, "text": " I mean, I can test the AC and stuff."}, {"offsets": {"from": 352700, "to": 353700}, "text": " But, I'm sure the AC works."}, {"offsets": {"from": 353700, "to": 355700}, "text": " Like, everything, everything works just fine."}, {"offsets": {"from": 355700, "to": 358700}, "text": " So, ah, seriously?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 358700, "to": 361700}, "text": " That battery terminal corroded off and that's it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 361700, "to": 362700}, "text": " I can't believe that's it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 362700, "to": 365700}, "text": " Because, like Varda, I was using those at the time."}, {"offsets": {"from": 365700, "to": 367700}, "text": " That, you know, I got a whole bunch of them."}, {"offsets": {"from": 367700, "to": 369700}, "text": " I always got like a box of them."}, {"offsets": {"from": 369700, "to": 372700}, "text": " I was using those at the time that I was testing these."}, {"offsets": {"from": 372700, "to": 375700}, "text": " So, this, this isn't like the original one that came with it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 375700, "to": 378700}, "text": " Um, that would have, I'm sure I would have opened these."}, {"offsets": {"from": 378700, "to": 380700}, "text": " I'm sure I opened these all."}, {"offsets": {"from": 380700, "to": 382700}, "text": " And I, and I checked them."}, {"offsets": {"from": 382700, "to": 386700}, "text": " So, like, maybe I missed this one for some reason."}, {"offsets": {"from": 386700, "to": 390700}, "text": " Or maybe I didn't test it because it was maybe the only 870 model that I had or something."}, {"offsets": {"from": 390700, "to": 393700}, "text": " But, as far as I know, it's the same as the 916."}, {"offsets": {"from": 393700, "to": 395700}, "text": " And, it's a winner."}, {"offsets": {"from": 395700, "to": 396700}, "text": " Next."}, {"offsets": {"from": 396700, "to": 398700}, "text": " It's going to be embarrassing if they're all the same."}, {"offsets": {"from": 398700, "to": 401700}, "text": " Anyway, this is Australian Air Force as well."}, {"offsets": {"from": 401700, "to": 405700}, "text": " So, ADFCAL's Australian Defence Force Calibration."}, {"offsets": {"from": 405700, "to": 408700}, "text": " I got a lot of stuff in the Australian Defence Force Calibration lab."}, {"offsets": {"from": 408700, "to": 409700}, "text": " April 10."}, {"offsets": {"from": 409700, "to": 413700}, "text": " So, they're all like, ah, 2010 vintage."}, {"offsets": {"from": 413700, "to": 416700}, "text": " So, that's great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 417700, "to": 418700}, "text": " What is?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 418700, "to": 421700}, "text": " I thought that was like, leakage or something."}, {"offsets": {"from": 421700, "to": 423700}, "text": " But, that's not liquid."}, {"offsets": {"from": 423700, "to": 427700}, "text": " It's, it's had some sticky substance on it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 427700, "to": 430700}, "text": " Somebody's like, I don't know."}, {"offsets": {"from": 430700, "to": 434700}, "text": " Somebody in the Australian Defence Force has, ah, ah, spilt their coffee on that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 434700, "to": 435700}, "text": " There's no smell to it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 435700, "to": 436700}, "text": " Mmm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 436700, "to": 438700}, "text": " Anyway, um, yeah, nothing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 438700, "to": 440700}, "text": " So, let's open her up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 440700, "to": 443700}, "text": " I swear if all these work, I'm going to be so embarrassed."}, {"offsets": {"from": 443700, "to": 444700}, "text": " Whoa."}, {"offsets": {"from": 444700, "to": 446700}, "text": " Yeah, it's got a Dura-Leak in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 446700, "to": 448700}, "text": " But, it hasn't leaked."}, {"offsets": {"from": 448700, "to": 449700}, "text": " Oh."}, {"offsets": {"from": 449700, "to": 451700}, "text": " March 2013."}, {"offsets": {"from": 451700, "to": 452700}, "text": " Oops."}, {"offsets": {"from": 452700, "to": 455700}, "text": " Um, so."}, {"offsets": {"from": 455700, "to": 457700}, "text": " Oh, yeah, hang on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 457700, "to": 458700}, "text": " There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 458700, "to": 460700}, "text": " There's a bit of, bit of corrosion in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 460700, "to": 462700}, "text": " So, I'll clean that up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 462700, "to": 463700}, "text": " So, let's clean that up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 463700, "to": 465700}, "text": " I've got the vinegar."}, {"offsets": {"from": 465700, "to": 468700}, "text": " So, neutralize that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 468700, "to": 470700}, "text": " Finish that off with some isopropyl."}, {"offsets": {"from": 470700, "to": 471700}, "text": " Oh."}, {"offsets": {"from": 471700, "to": 473700}, "text": " Shouldn't do that on my good mat here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 473700, "to": 474700}, "text": " Really."}, {"offsets": {"from": 474700, "to": 476700}, "text": " I, yeah, nah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 476700, "to": 478700}, "text": " I should do that over on the dirty bench."}, {"offsets": {"from": 478700, "to": 479700}, "text": " The dirty bench."}, {"offsets": {"from": 479700, "to": 481700}, "text": " Ooh, that's what she said."}, {"offsets": {"from": 481700, "to": 483700}, "text": " So, again, let's tighten up the jacks."}, {"offsets": {"from": 483700, "to": 485700}, "text": " Those ones were pretty tight."}, {"offsets": {"from": 485700, "to": 487700}, "text": " Jeez."}, {"offsets": {"from": 487700, "to": 488700}, "text": " Oh."}, {"offsets": {"from": 488700, "to": 491700}, "text": " There was something rattling around in here, and it was that plastic clip."}, {"offsets": {"from": 491700, "to": 494700}, "text": " Oh, I can't, where does that come from?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 494700, "to": 496700}, "text": " I don't see it on the bottom of the case."}, {"offsets": {"from": 496700, "to": 497700}, "text": " Oh, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 497700, "to": 498700}, "text": " Okay, yeah, yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 498700, "to": 499700}, "text": " It's broken off from the top."}, {"offsets": {"from": 499700, "to": 501700}, "text": " They've got those two clips on the top there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 501700, "to": 502700}, "text": " So, that one's broken off."}, {"offsets": {"from": 502700, "to": 503700}, "text": " Oopsie."}, {"offsets": {"from": 503700, "to": 505700}, "text": " Alright, we've got a freshie."}, {"offsets": {"from": 505700, "to": 508700}, "text": " I reckon these are all going to be good."}, {"offsets": {"from": 508700, "to": 514700}, "text": " I, like, I, I don't know why."}, {"offsets": {"from": 514700, "to": 515700}, "text": " Oh, boy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 515700, "to": 517700}, "text": " Alright, let's try it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 517700, "to": 521700}, "text": " Milliamps, 99.93."}, {"offsets": {"from": 521700, "to": 523700}, "text": " So, that's good."}, {"offsets": {"from": 523700, "to": 528700}, "text": " 10 milliamps, 9.97, 9.98."}, {"offsets": {"from": 528700, "to": 533700}, "text": " And 1 milliamp, go over to 1000 microamps there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 533700, "to": 534700}, "text": " That's good."}, {"offsets": {"from": 534700, "to": 537700}, "text": " Sorry if you weren't seeing that, but, yeah, that's all good."}, {"offsets": {"from": 537700, "to": 539700}, "text": " So, current is fine."}, {"offsets": {"from": 539700, "to": 542700}, "text": " The amps jack, here you go, no worries."}, {"offsets": {"from": 542700, "to": 545700}, "text": " It's not terribly accurate down at the bottom end of that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 545700, "to": 547700}, "text": " 1 volt."}, {"offsets": {"from": 547700, "to": 549700}, "text": " Yeah, yeah, yeah, it's bang on."}, {"offsets": {"from": 549700, "to": 551700}, "text": " Oh, I'm sick of having these around the wrong way."}, {"offsets": {"from": 551700, "to": 552700}, "text": " It's bugging me."}, {"offsets": {"from": 552700, "to": 556700}, "text": " 9.999999991."}, {"offsets": {"from": 556700, "to": 557700}, "text": " One!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 557700, "to": 558700}, "text": " One!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 558700, "to": 559700}, "text": " It's bang on!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 559700, "to": 560700}, "text": " 100 millivolt range."}, {"offsets": {"from": 560700, "to": 563700}, "text": " Yeah, it's going to be bang, like, seriously?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 563700, "to": 565700}, "text": " Yep, yep, it's within spec."}, {"offsets": {"from": 565700, "to": 567700}, "text": " Well, this is just getting embarrassing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 567700, "to": 573700}, "text": " Looks like I've had a whole bunch of perfectly good three."}, {"offsets": {"from": 573700, "to": 578700}, "text": " Well, yeah, three, because I've got one for sale at the moment on my eBay store."}, {"offsets": {"from": 578700, "to": 581700}, "text": " And that one, and this one, they'll go for sale as well."}, {"offsets": {"from": 581700, "to": 583700}, "text": " So, yeah, I'll start the auction at 99 cents."}, {"offsets": {"from": 583700, "to": 586700}, "text": " This one's a bit how you're doing on the bottom."}, {"offsets": {"from": 586700, "to": 594700}, "text": " As I said, it's had something spill on there, but I'm not sure if that's going to come off."}, {"offsets": {"from": 594700, "to": 596700}, "text": " Eh, I don't know."}, {"offsets": {"from": 596700, "to": 600700}, "text": " I don't know, it just seems like there's something on there, but I don't know."}, {"offsets": {"from": 600700, "to": 602700}, "text": " I don't know what exactly."}, {"offsets": {"from": 602700, "to": 605700}, "text": " But anyway, these are all the range switches feel absolutely,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 605700, "to": 609700}, "text": " this is a really good feeling range switch, by the way, on these bad boys."}, {"offsets": {"from": 609700, "to": 611700}, "text": " So, they're really good."}, {"offsets": {"from": 611700, "to": 614700}, "text": " The LCD, everything's fine."}, {"offsets": {"from": 614700, "to": 617700}, "text": " And it spot tests on all the, you know, current, you know,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 617700, "to": 620700}, "text": " if it spot tests on those, like, there could be a fault on AC volts,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 620700, "to": 622700}, "text": " or there could be a fault on cap or something."}, {"offsets": {"from": 622700, "to": 628700}, "text": " But, like, 99.9% sure this bad boy's fully operational."}, {"offsets": {"from": 628700, "to": 633700}, "text": " You see, these have had, like, a red failed tag on them,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 633700, "to": 635700}, "text": " and somebody's gone to the effort to cable tie it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 635700, "to": 638700}, "text": " It originally had a tag on there that would have had info or something."}, {"offsets": {"from": 638700, "to": 640700}, "text": " I can't remember, you'd have to watch my original video."}, {"offsets": {"from": 640700, "to": 642700}, "text": " Maybe I pulled it off."}, {"offsets": {"from": 642700, "to": 647700}, "text": " This one last calibrated 2008, so this one's older than those."}, {"offsets": {"from": 647700, "to": 649700}, "text": " Yeah, look at that, 2008."}, {"offsets": {"from": 649700, "to": 655700}, "text": " And again, this seems to be, like, it's discoloured in some way."}, {"offsets": {"from": 655700, "to": 658700}, "text": " Like, I don't know."}, {"offsets": {"from": 658700, "to": 662700}, "text": " So, not sure what kind of life these things have."}, {"offsets": {"from": 662700, "to": 665700}, "text": " By the way, oh, that one's missing a screw."}, {"offsets": {"from": 665700, "to": 668700}, "text": " Okay, there you go. One screw missing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 668700, "to": 670700}, "text": " Don't have a replacement."}, {"offsets": {"from": 670700, "to": 673700}, "text": " I couldn't be bothered looking through my tin collection."}, {"offsets": {"from": 673700, "to": 675700}, "text": " Oh, oh, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 675700, "to": 678700}, "text": " This one's..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 678700, "to": 681700}, "text": " Oh, and again, is that, like..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 681700, "to": 684700}, "text": " Oh, look at that. What's that powder?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 684700, "to": 686700}, "text": " Oh, okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 686700, "to": 688700}, "text": " That needs a good clean."}, {"offsets": {"from": 688700, "to": 691700}, "text": " Um, this battery holder has seen better days."}, {"offsets": {"from": 691700, "to": 693700}, "text": " Look at that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 693700, "to": 695700}, "text": " That's pretty how you do it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 695700, "to": 697700}, "text": " Anyway, like, there's no leakage in any..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 697700, "to": 699700}, "text": " Oh, there you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 699700, "to": 704700}, "text": " And yeah, part of the battery clip is off there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 704700, "to": 709700}, "text": " So it could do with a replacement battery snap."}, {"offsets": {"from": 709700, "to": 711700}, "text": " Does that still..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 711700, "to": 713700}, "text": " Yeah, no, anyway."}, {"offsets": {"from": 713700, "to": 715700}, "text": " It should be able to at least..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 715700, "to": 717700}, "text": " Nah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 717700, "to": 719700}, "text": " Nah, what have I got?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 719700, "to": 721700}, "text": " Got a genuine faulty one by the looks of it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 721700, "to": 723700}, "text": " Yeah, there you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 723700, "to": 725700}, "text": " Got a genuine dead-ski one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 725700, "to": 727700}, "text": " But, um..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 727700, "to": 729700}, "text": " All that stuff in the bottom of the case"}, {"offsets": {"from": 729700, "to": 732700}, "text": " doesn't instill me with a lot of confidence."}, {"offsets": {"from": 732700, "to": 734700}, "text": " Oh, duh."}, {"offsets": {"from": 734700, "to": 736700}, "text": " Well, there's your problem."}, {"offsets": {"from": 736700, "to": 738700}, "text": " Yeah, no, we definitely need a new battery snap."}, {"offsets": {"from": 738700, "to": 740700}, "text": " Don't know if I have any spare battery snaps."}, {"offsets": {"from": 740700, "to": 742700}, "text": " Might have to find one somewhere."}, {"offsets": {"from": 742700, "to": 744700}, "text": " But anyway, that's the, uh..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 744700, "to": 746700}, "text": " That's the strain relief for it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 746700, "to": 748700}, "text": " So, yeah, that's just..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 748700, "to": 750700}, "text": " Yeah, the design on these is not great."}, {"offsets": {"from": 750700, "to": 752700}, "text": " Oh, that's my finger."}, {"offsets": {"from": 752700, "to": 754700}, "text": " Or is that..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 754700, "to": 757700}, "text": " Still got some of that white stuff in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 757700, "to": 759700}, "text": " It's not..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 759700, "to": 761700}, "text": " It's like caked on there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 761700, "to": 762700}, "text": " It's really weird."}, {"offsets": {"from": 762700, "to": 764700}, "text": " It's not like the magic smoke has escaped from anything"}, {"offsets": {"from": 764700, "to": 766700}, "text": " and has coated all the inside."}, {"offsets": {"from": 766700, "to": 768700}, "text": " You know, if anything blows up,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 768700, "to": 770700}, "text": " it's going to be around the input stuff."}, {"offsets": {"from": 770700, "to": 772700}, "text": " I'm not seeing it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 772700, "to": 774700}, "text": " There's no burnt tracks."}, {"offsets": {"from": 774700, "to": 776700}, "text": " There's no sign of any overload to speak of, really."}, {"offsets": {"from": 776700, "to": 778700}, "text": " Let's see if we can get a new battery snap."}, {"offsets": {"from": 778700, "to": 780700}, "text": " I'll get back to you."}, {"offsets": {"from": 780700, "to": 782700}, "text": " Well, I don't have any battery snaps to hand,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 782700, "to": 784700}, "text": " but we can actually make one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 784700, "to": 786700}, "text": " Take a dead 9-volt battery,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 786700, "to": 788700}, "text": " and hopefully, if we open this bad boy up,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 788700, "to": 790700}, "text": " we should be able to..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 790700, "to": 792700}, "text": " Often, you can get"}, {"offsets": {"from": 792700, "to": 794700}, "text": " the connector"}, {"offsets": {"from": 794700, "to": 796700}, "text": " out of the top,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 796700, "to": 798700}, "text": " and bingo, you got yourself"}, {"offsets": {"from": 798700, "to": 800700}, "text": " a battery snap."}, {"offsets": {"from": 800700, "to": 802700}, "text": " So I'll just..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 802700, "to": 804700}, "text": " See that?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 804700, "to": 806700}, "text": " Maybe we can get that off."}, {"offsets": {"from": 806700, "to": 808700}, "text": " Some of them are like integrated, but some are"}, {"offsets": {"from": 808700, "to": 810700}, "text": " actually separate, and you can actually solder"}, {"offsets": {"from": 810700, "to": 812700}, "text": " onto the back. They'll have the"}, {"offsets": {"from": 812700, "to": 814700}, "text": " little metal tabs coming out,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 814700, "to": 816700}, "text": " and you can solder them onto your wires and use them as battery snaps."}, {"offsets": {"from": 816700, "to": 818700}, "text": " There we go, we got that open."}, {"offsets": {"from": 818700, "to": 820700}, "text": " Now, there we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 820700, "to": 822700}, "text": " Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 822700, "to": 824700}, "text": " Yeah, yep, there you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 824700, "to": 826700}, "text": " No worries whatsoever."}, {"offsets": {"from": 826700, "to": 828700}, "text": " We can reuse..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 828700, "to": 830700}, "text": " Don't throw out your dead 9-volt batteries."}, {"offsets": {"from": 830700, "to": 832700}, "text": " Well, do if they leak, and you got"}, {"offsets": {"from": 832700, "to": 834700}, "text": " crap all over it, but yeah, there you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 834700, "to": 836700}, "text": " We can just"}, {"offsets": {"from": 836700, "to": 838700}, "text": " reuse"}, {"offsets": {"from": 838700, "to": 840700}, "text": " this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 840700, "to": 842700}, "text": " That whole thing's going to come out"}, {"offsets": {"from": 842700, "to": 844700}, "text": " as a can."}, {"offsets": {"from": 844700, "to": 846700}, "text": " I don't know if I've taken a VARTA apart before,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 846700, "to": 848700}, "text": " because some of them have six 4A"}, {"offsets": {"from": 848700, "to": 850700}, "text": " cells, but some of them are"}, {"offsets": {"from": 850700, "to": 852700}, "text": " prismatic cells,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 852700, "to": 854700}, "text": " and"}, {"offsets": {"from": 854700, "to": 856700}, "text": " they can be very different construction."}, {"offsets": {"from": 856700, "to": 858700}, "text": " I'm going to cut that tab."}, {"offsets": {"from": 858700, "to": 860700}, "text": " Should be able to solder onto the back of that,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 860700, "to": 862700}, "text": " of course. It's just paper on the back there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 862700, "to": 864700}, "text": " And that is just going to be..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 864700, "to": 866700}, "text": " Oh, I don't want to use my good"}, {"offsets": {"from": 866700, "to": 868700}, "text": " cutters. These are actually reverse"}, {"offsets": {"from": 868700, "to": 870700}, "text": " flush cutters."}, {"offsets": {"from": 870700, "to": 872700}, "text": " And this whole thing looks..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 872700, "to": 874700}, "text": " does look prismatic."}, {"offsets": {"from": 874700, "to": 876700}, "text": " That doesn't look like we got our"}, {"offsets": {"from": 876700, "to": 878700}, "text": " six double A's in there. Looks like it's got"}, {"offsets": {"from": 878700, "to": 880700}, "text": " sealed prismatic"}, {"offsets": {"from": 880700, "to": 882700}, "text": " cells. There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 882700, "to": 884700}, "text": " Anyway, this is not"}, {"offsets": {"from": 884700, "to": 886700}, "text": " a teardown of that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 886700, "to": 888700}, "text": " I'll get rid of the"}, {"offsets": {"from": 888700, "to": 890700}, "text": " snippety doo-dah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 890700, "to": 892700}, "text": " We have ourselves"}, {"offsets": {"from": 892700, "to": 894700}, "text": " a battery snap."}, {"offsets": {"from": 894700, "to": 896700}, "text": " There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 896700, "to": 898700}, "text": " That will work a treat. There we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 898700, "to": 900700}, "text": " And yeah, go ahead, bitch in the"}, {"offsets": {"from": 900700, "to": 902700}, "text": " comments down below, but"}, {"offsets": {"from": 902700, "to": 904700}, "text": " that's good enough for Australia."}, {"offsets": {"from": 904700, "to": 906700}, "text": " That's going to get us back up and running."}, {"offsets": {"from": 906700, "to": 908700}, "text": " There we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 912700, "to": 914700}, "text": " Like I bought one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 914700, "to": 916700}, "text": " Nah, that's..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 916700, "to": 918700}, "text": " I think that wire is corroded"}, {"offsets": {"from": 918700, "to": 920700}, "text": " away"}, {"offsets": {"from": 920700, "to": 922700}, "text": " unfortunately. This one seemed"}, {"offsets": {"from": 922700, "to": 924700}, "text": " fine, but nah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 924700, "to": 926700}, "text": " That one's corroded right up"}, {"offsets": {"from": 926700, "to": 928700}, "text": " the clacker."}, {"offsets": {"from": 928700, "to": 930700}, "text": " Okay, so let's put a new wire in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 930700, "to": 932700}, "text": " It's a bit thicker"}, {"offsets": {"from": 932700, "to": 934700}, "text": " than the old one. That's what"}, {"offsets": {"from": 934700, "to": 936700}, "text": " she said. But"}, {"offsets": {"from": 936700, "to": 938700}, "text": " it does feed through."}, {"offsets": {"from": 938700, "to": 940700}, "text": " And"}, {"offsets": {"from": 940700, "to": 942700}, "text": " there's your strain relief."}, {"offsets": {"from": 942700, "to": 944700}, "text": " The"}, {"offsets": {"from": 944700, "to": 946700}, "text": " insulation's not great on that. It melts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 946700, "to": 948700}, "text": " It's not very high quality, but"}, {"offsets": {"from": 948700, "to": 950700}, "text": " she'll be right."}, {"offsets": {"from": 950700, "to": 952700}, "text": " Again, good enough for Australia."}, {"offsets": {"from": 952700, "to": 954700}, "text": " After all this, I hope it works. I still haven't"}, {"offsets": {"from": 954700, "to": 956700}, "text": " even tested it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 956700, "to": 958700}, "text": " It's like sewing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 958700, "to": 960700}, "text": " I haven't even tested"}, {"offsets": {"from": 960700, "to": 962700}, "text": " if this is going to work."}, {"offsets": {"from": 962700, "to": 964700}, "text": " So is that a suitable"}, {"offsets": {"from": 964700, "to": 966700}, "text": " length there? Yeah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 966700, "to": 968700}, "text": " I'll just cut it there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 968700, "to": 970700}, "text": " Will it actually work? Well,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 970700, "to": 972700}, "text": " we'll find out. Based on our previous"}, {"offsets": {"from": 972700, "to": 974700}, "text": " ones, though. Confidence"}, {"offsets": {"from": 974700, "to": 976700}, "text": " is high. I repeat, confidence"}, {"offsets": {"from": 976700, "to": 978700}, "text": " is high. Confidence is"}, {"offsets": {"from": 978700, "to": 980700}, "text": " high. I repeat, confidence"}, {"offsets": {"from": 980700, "to": 982700}, "text": " is high. Okay, I'm gonna..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 982700, "to": 984700}, "text": " It's easier to solder on..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 984700, "to": 986700}, "text": " Oh, to the... Oh, that's"}, {"offsets": {"from": 986700, "to": 988700}, "text": " coming out. Oh."}, {"offsets": {"from": 988700, "to": 990700}, "text": " Oops. Oops."}, {"offsets": {"from": 990700, "to": 992700}, "text": " A bit too much heat there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 992700, "to": 994700}, "text": " Is it sealed back in?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 994700, "to": 996700}, "text": " Oops."}, {"offsets": {"from": 996700, "to": 998700}, "text": " Um..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 998700, "to": 1000700}, "text": " It'll get us up and running."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1000700, "to": 1002700}, "text": " Oh, oh, oh, there we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1002700, "to": 1004700}, "text": " There we go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1004700, "to": 1006700}, "text": " She's working. Okay."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1006700, "to": 1008700}, "text": " Let me put it back together."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1008700, "to": 1010700}, "text": " After I clean out that case,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1010700, "to": 1012700}, "text": " because that case is horrible."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1012700, "to": 1014700}, "text": " Oops, my hard drive"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1014700, "to": 1016700}, "text": " just filled up on my ATMR switcher."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1016700, "to": 1018700}, "text": " I should delete stuff."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1018700, "to": 1020700}, "text": " It's a 1TB drive. I haven't deleted"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1020700, "to": 1022700}, "text": " stuff in a while. Anyway,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1022700, "to": 1024699}, "text": " I'll redo what I just said"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1024699, "to": 1026699}, "text": " there. You can see"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1026699, "to": 1028699}, "text": " the exposed contacts in there,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1028699, "to": 1030699}, "text": " but that's not an"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1030699, "to": 1032699}, "text": " electrical hazard. It's not a problem"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1032699, "to": 1034699}, "text": " because, like, there's nothing,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1034699, "to": 1036699}, "text": " there's no other contacts near it. It's just a"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1036699, "to": 1038699}, "text": " looks thing, really,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1038699, "to": 1040699}, "text": " so it's not really a problem."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1040699, "to": 1042699}, "text": " If you've got the meter open,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1042699, "to": 1044699}, "text": " it's a safety hazard. If you've got the meter"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1044699, "to": 1046699}, "text": " open, well, there's your"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1046699, "to": 1048699}, "text": " safety hazard. Unfortunately,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1048699, "to": 1050699}, "text": " we are missing the one screw there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1050699, "to": 1052699}, "text": " Alright, let's go to the videotape."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1052699, "to": 1054699}, "text": " 100.00..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1054699, "to": 1056699}, "text": " 0.03"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1056699, "to": 1058699}, "text": " millivolts... 0.999"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1058699, "to": 1060699}, "text": " 95..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1060699, "to": 1062699}, "text": 